License(s): MIT
License text:
     _        ___  ____ ____  ____                _     _
    |_|_ _   / _ \/ ___/ ___||  _ \   _   _ _   _(_) __| |
    _|_||_| | | | \___ \___ \| |_) | | | | | | | | |/ _` |
