Name: pako
Version: 1.0.11
License(s): (MIT AND Zlib)
License text:
  (The MIT License)
  Copyright (C) 2014-2017 by Vitaly Puzrin and Andrei Tuputcyn
  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
